: p. 410&#8211;5.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">10398099</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang B, Gojo I, and Fenton RG, Myeloid cell factor-1 is a critical survival factor for multiple myeloma. Blood, 2002. 99(6): p. 1885&#8211;93.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">11877256</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Beroukhim R, et al. , The landscape of somatic copy-number alteration across human cancers. Nature, 2010. 463(7283): p. 899&#8211;905.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2826709</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20164920</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Kojima K, et al. , Mdm2 inhibitor Nutlin-3a induces p53-mediated apoptosis by transcription-dependent and transcription-independent mechanisms and may overcome Atm-mediated resistance to fludarabine in chronic lymphocytic leukemia. Blood, 2006. 108(3): p. 993&#8211;1000.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC1895860</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16543464</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hasegawa H, et al. , Activation of p53 by Nutlin-3a, an antagonist of MDM2, induces apoptosis and cellular senescence in adult T-cell leukemia cells. Leukemia, 2009. 23(11): p. 2090&#8211;101.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">19710698</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Tait SW and Green DR, Mitochondria and cell death: outer membrane permeabilization and beyond. Nat Rev Mol Cell Biol, 2010. 11(9): p. 621&#8211;32.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20683470</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Juin P, et al. , Decoding and unlocking the BCL-2 dependency of cancer cells. Nat Rev Cancer, 2013. 13(7): p. 455&#8211;65.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23783119</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Oltersdorf T, et al. , An i